  <Description classID="9876543210ABCDEF" contentType="text/html">
    <Abstract>SQL injection allows attackers to execute arbitrary SQL.</Abstract>
    <Explanation>The application concatenates user input directly into a SQL query.</Explanation>
    <Recommendations>Use parameterised queries.</Recommendations>
  </Description>
  <Description classID="AABBCCDDEEFF1234" contentType="text/html">
    <Abstract>Use a proper logging facility instead of System.out.</Abstract>
    <Explanation>System.out logging cannot be controlled at runtime.</Explanation>
    <Recommendations>Use the project's logging library (e.g. SLF4J).</Recommendations>
  </Description>
